  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-better-villagers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/kS90mr4y?color=34D058&label=Modrinth Downloads&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-better-villager\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1108525?color=FC7303&label=CurseForge Downloads&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\"></a> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/Reggarfgod/create_better_villagers?color=6E40C9&label=Issues&logo=github\"> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/Aq9ZuPMWSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/430776550443581450?color=5865F2&label=Online Users&logo=discord\"></a><br><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>[Create-6+ ✓]</strong></span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;color:#e5e5e5\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fzap-hosting.com%252freggarf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1010929/description_2dbdedf7-e1a0-4bcd-86a6-01c26447af70.png\"></strong></a></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>СПАСИБО НАШИМ СПОНСОРАМ</strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>СПАСИБО ZAP-HOSTING! Используйте код Reggarf-1047 для скидки 20% на любой заказ!</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fzap-hosting.com%252freggarf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://zap-hosting.com/reggarf</a></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_9db24c00-7ce9-4c29-af58-e44c53e38af4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"493\" height=\"493\"></p>\n<div style=\"display:flex\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Create: Better Villager</span> добавляет множество деревенских профессий из мода Create <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_0120b73c-046a-4b20-b605-562d6bff7358.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"34\" height=\"34\"></strong></div>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Список функций</strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Андезитовый рабочий</span></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;Продает детали мода Create из андезита</li>\n</ul>\n<div>\n<pre style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">Рабочая станция - BASIN</span></pre>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_da38d869-08c8-4802-9661-9556b54df776.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"408\" height=\"408\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Латунный рабочий</span></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;Продает детали мода Create из латуни</li>\n</ul>\n<div>\n<pre style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>Рабочая станция - ROTATION_SPEED_CONTROLLER</strong></span></pre>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_9a5dab7e-714a-438e-8975-0f9c0998d18e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"475\" height=\"475\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#f1c40f\"><strong>Медный рабочий</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;Продает детали мода Create из меди&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<div>\n<pre style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">Рабочая станция - STEAM_ENGINE</span></pre>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_5f749160-0cf1-4092-b1bc-24e489aceb86.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"416\" height=\"416\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Шахтёр</span></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Покупает и продает сырые детали из андезита, меди и латуни</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<div>\n<pre style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">Рабочая станция - MECHANICAL_ARM</span></pre>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>ВИДЕО ОБЗОР МОДА</strong>&nbsp;</h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/zLU_LUCBQJY?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Спасибо dejojotheawsome за</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">обзор мода&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Переходите к 2:40 для просмотра обзора Create: Better Villager&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Найдите Create: Better Villager на GitHub или Modrinth</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fzap-hosting.com%252fcreateletscreate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_7186e4e2-24e8-4cfd-80c1-294cafaf58c9.gif\" alt=\"\"></strong></a></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
